- [ ] All array operations are guarded: (items ?? []).map(...) and Array.isArray checks throughout frontend and backend data handling
- [ ] useState initializations for arrays are in place: useState<Workflow[]>([]) and useState<WorkflowRun[]>([])
- [ ] Data models and API contracts validated; responses validated with shape checks

